      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Noted, it seems that we're moving toward a much stricter moderation approach that heavily relies on predetermined rules. I understand the need for consistency and predictability, which could pave the way for a smoother user experience and less strain on our resources. I'll pivot my strategy accordingly to accommodate the specific needs of the new system and will provide support whenever you need it. Thank you for keeping us updated on these important changes.",
